OOF Loop demo — sum numbers 1 to 100.

OOGA i: ROCK BE 1
OOGA s: ROCK BE 0
UGGA WHILE i SMALLR IS 100
    s GETS s PLUS i
    i GETS i PLUS 1
UGHA
SAY s

OOF Infinite loop with break
OOGA n: ROCK BE 0
UGGA DO
    n GETS n PLUS 1
    IFF n IS 3
        STOP
    UGHA
UGHA
SAY "CAVE COUNT TO 3 THEN STOP"
